# Wave T31 (Beacon kit): harbourfloor — Beacon City's
# registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the
# -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). HARBOUR
# PLANK DECKING: wide weathered deck planks, iron bolt heads
# at the seams, salt-pale wear along the plank centres. A
# bolted harbour deck — unlike Tidewall's driftfloor shore
# boards, Arcport's boardwalk (kept for Arcport alone),
# Mistford's bleached planks, Fairhaven's quay stone.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T31-BEACON-PLAN.)
